# FlowTrace runtime output.
# NOTE: scoped deliberately — a blanket `*.jsonl` also swallowed
# examples/golden/**/expected.jsonl, which is why the golden fixtures
# could never be committed and `make validate-schema` validated nothing.
flowtrace.jsonl
flowtrace-*.jsonl
**/flowtrace.jsonl
**/flowtrace-*.jsonl

